Hi {{member_name}},

Wonderful — you completed your onboarding in {{completion_time}}. That kind of momentum is exactly what we look for.

One final step before your access is switched on: read and digitally acknowledge the {{program_name}} Code of Conduct.

{{signing_link}}

This link stays valid until {{expiry_date}} ({{expiry_days}} days).

Once acknowledged, your group and platform access will be arranged right away.

Warm regards,
{{company_name}}
{{support_email}}

Hi {{member_name}},

Thank you for completing your onboarding ({{completion_time}}).

Before we can switch on your {{program_name}} access, please read and digitally acknowledge the Code of Conduct using the secure link below.

{{signing_link}}

Please complete this at your earliest convenience — the link stays valid until {{expiry_date}} ({{expiry_days}} days). If it expires, contact us and we will issue a fresh one.

As soon as it is acknowledged, your group and platform access will be arranged.

Warm regards,
{{company_name}}
{{support_email}}
